      "writtenOn": "2026-09-11T14:19:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this single failure exposed both issues sequentially:\n1. It encoded an allintra sequence starting with a 17x1 frame under delta-q mode 3 (AV1E_SET_DELTAQ_MODE \u003d 3). At 17x1 (flow_height \u003d 0), border filling exceeded the stride and caused memcpy-param-overlap in disflow.\n\n2. Once the 17x1 frame finished, the testcase switched resolution to 320x240. Because cpi-\u003eframe_info was not updated in av1_update_frame_size() and mb_weber_stats / mb_delta_q were only allocated for the initial 17x1 size, this immediately crashed with a heap-buffer-overflow in perceptual AI.\n\nSo both fixes were needed for this case to pass.",
      "parentUuid": "846efe57_44892fd4",
      "revId": "56f061594827d6e0751129abda9affec7c7f4ada",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
